        "bookmark_count":0,
        "impression_count":983,
        "like_count":10,
        "quote_count":0,
        "reply_count":0,
        "retweet_count":0
      },
      "text":"To get started with DIEM, connect your wallet to your Venice account on the token dashboard:\n\nhttps://t.co/hI3kb6bzaE"
    },
    {
      "author_id":"1764736490515685376",
      "conversation_id":"2113345252677632405",
      "created_at":"2026-10-22T19:02:40.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids":[
        "2113345311154524501"
      ],
      "id":"2113345311154524501",
      "public_metrics":{
        "bookmark_count":1,
        "impression_count":980,
        "like_count":9,
        "quote_count":0,
        "reply_count":1,
        "retweet_count":1
      },
      "text":"DIEM is always spent first, before account credits.\n\nIf you go past your day's DIEM allowance, your regular USD credits keep you going.\n\nDIEM credits do not roll over."
    },
    {
      "author_id":"1764736490515685376",
      "conversation_id":"2113345252677632405",
      "created_at":"2026-10-22T19:02:38.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids":[
        "2113345299528011928"
      ],
      "id":"2113345299528011928",
      "public_metrics":{
        "bookmark_count":0,
        "impression_count":410,
        "like_count":8,
        "quote_count":0,
        "reply_count":1,
        "retweet_count":0
      },
      "text":"Minted DIEM can also be sold on the market.\n\nBut remember that if you sell it, your VVV stays locked until you burn the same amount of DIEM that you originally minted.\n\nBe careful!"
    },
    {
      "author_id":"1764736490515685376",
      "conversation_id":"2113345252677632405",
      "created_at":"2026-10-22T19:02:35.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids":[
        "2113345287947526151"
      ],
      "id":"2113345287947526151",
      "public_metrics":{
        "bookmark_count":0,
        "impression_count":436,
        "like_count":7,
        "quote_count":0,
        "reply_count":1,
        "retweet_count":0
      },
      "text":"If you minted DIEM:\n\nTo get your VVV back, you must burn the same amount of DIEM you minted.\n\nYour staked VVV unlocks once the DIEM has been burned."
    },
    {
      "author_id":"1764736490515685376",
      "conversation_id":"2113345252677632405",
      "created_at":"2026-10-22T19:02:32.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids":[
        "2113345276211814794"
      ],
      "id":"2113345276211814794",
      "public_metrics":{
        "bookmark_count":0,
        "impression_count":678,
        "like_count":15,
        "quote_count":0,
        "reply_count":2,
        "retweet_count":0
      },
      "text":"There are two ways to acquire DIEM:\n\n1. Buy it on the market and stake it.\n\n2. Stake VVV (Venice's token) and \"mint\" your own."
    },
    {
      "author_id":"1764736490515685376",
      "conversation_id":"2113345252677632405",
      "created_at":"2026-10-22T19:02:29.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids":[
        "2113345264572649546"
      ],
      "id":"2113345264572649546",
      "public_metrics":{
        "bookmark_count":0,
        "impression_count":1528,
        "like_count":23,
        "quote_count":0,
        "reply_count":3,
        "retweet_count":0
      },
      "text":"One staked DIEM gives you one dollar of Venice credit per day.\n\n($1 = 100 credits)\n\nAs long as it remains staked, your DIEM allowance refreshes daily at 00:00 UTC."
    },
    {
      "author_id":"1764736490515685376",
      "conversation_id":"2113345252677632405",
